    "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace NotchNook se snaží co nejlépe odhadnout šířku zářezu, ale někdy se může trochu nepřesné. Zde ji můžete jemně doladit. Musí mít přesně stejnou velikost jako váš výřez."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook versucht, die Breite zu erraten, aber manchmal kann dies etwas abweichen. Hier kannst du es feintunen. Es muss genau die gleiche Größe deiner Notch haben."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook intenta determinar el ancho de tu notch, pero a veces puede no ser preciso. Aquí puedes ajustarlo con precisión. Debe ser exactamente del mismo tamaño que tu notch."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook yrittää parhaansa arvata notchin leveyden, mutta joskus se voi olla hieman väärässä. Tässä voit hienosäätää sen. Sen täytyy olla täsmälleen saman kokoinen kuin notchisi."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook fait de son mieux pour deviner la largeur de l'encoche, mais il arrive qu'il se trompe un peu. Ici, vous pouvez l'affiner. Elle doit être exactement de la même taille que votre encoche."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook cerca di indovinare la larghezza del notch, ma a volte può essere un po' errata. Qui puoi perfezionarla. Deve essere esattamente la stessa dimensione della tua notch."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNookはノッチの幅を認識して表示しますが、誤差が生じることがあります。その場合は微調整を行って、ノッチのサイズと完全に一致させる必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook은 노치의 너비를 추측하기 위해 최선을 다하지만 때때로 약간 틀어질 수 있습니다. 여기서 미세 조정이 가능합니다. 이 너비는 실제 노치의 크기와 정확히 일치해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook probeert zo goed mogelijk de breedte van je notch te raden, maar soms kan het een beetje afwijken. Hier kun je het finetunen. Het moet precies dezelfde grootte hebben als je notch."
          }
        },
        "no" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook prøver det er beste på å gjette din notch bredde, men noen ganger kan det være litt av. Her kan du finjustere den. Den må være nøyaktig like stor som din notch."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook stara się jak najlepiej dopasować szerokość wycięcia, ale czasami może to być trochę nie tak. Tutaj możesz ją dostosować. Musi mieć dokładnie taki sam rozmiar jak wycięcie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook tenta adivinhar a largura do entalhe, mas às vezes pode ser um pouco errado. Aqui você pode ajustá-lo. Tem que ser exatamente do mesmo tamanho do seu entalhe."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook пытается угадать ширину Вашего выреза, но иногда это у него не получается. Здесь Вы можете с легкостью настроить ее. Она должна быть такой же ширины, как Ваш вырез."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "NotchNook tries it's best to guess you notch width, but sometimes it can be a bit off. Here you can fine tune it. It has to be exactly the same size of your notch."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook, çentik genişliğinizi tahmin etmek için elinden gelenin en iyisini yapmaya çalışır, ancak bazen biraz yanlış olabilir. Burada ince ayar yapabilirsiniz. Çentiğinizle tam olarak aynı boyutta olmalıdır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook намагається якнайкраще вгадати ширину вирізу, але іноді вона може бути невеликою. Тут ви можете його точно налаштувати. Він повинен точно відповідати розміру вашого вирізу."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook sẽ cố đoán chiều rộng của cái notch của bạn, nhưng đôi khi nó có thể bị lệch. Bạn có thể điều chỉnh nó ở đây. Nó phải là kích cỡ chính xác của cái notch của bạn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook 会尽力猜测你的凹槽宽度，但有时可能会有些偏差。你可以在这里进行微调。它必须与你的凹槽大小完全一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NotchNook 會偵測你的瀏海寬度，但有時可能會有些許偏差。你可以在這裡進行調整，且必須與你的瀏海大小一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
